abstract: "A controlled synthetic benchmark comparing REST orchestration with Kafka choreography behind one asynchronous mobile-money P2P transfer API, measuring correct goodput, ingress-to-commit completion latency, fault response and ledger correctness. Includes the redacted run evidence, the reproducible analysis, and the paper draft."
